  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nuh 102.04 \"Nursing home\" means any institution or facility, whether proprietary or non-proprietary, defined as a nursing home for licensing purposes pursuant to RSA 151.\n\nSource. #7592, eff 11-16-01",
